  "body": "Purchased in 1997 and loved by the same family for nearly 30 years, this home has seen children grow and countless memories made. Now ready for its next chapter, it combines beautiful native kauri flooring, inviting outdoor spaces and the everyday comfort of renovations over the years, including double glazing throughout, all in the sought after Rangitoto College zone.\r\n\r\nThe split level layout offers space to gather and room to retreat. A soaring ceiling with exposed timber beams creates a welcoming lounge, with doors opening wide onto an elevated balcony enjoying a neighbourhood outlook and a peep of the sea.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the spacious kitchen is a haven for keen cooks and entertainers, with two ovens, two sinks and plenty of room to prepare, serve and gather. Native kauri flooring adds warmth, while breakfast bar seating keeps family and guests connected to the conversation.\r\n\r\nDesigned for family living, the home features:\r\n\r\n* Four bedrooms, including a particularly generous private space with its own separate entrance, ideal for extended family or working from home\r\n* Three bathrooms: an ensuite, a main bathroom and a shared bathroom connecting two bedrooms\r\n* Double glazing throughout for year round comfort\r\n* Beautiful native kauri flooring\r\n* Generous entertaining decks, established greenery and a lawn for children to enjoy\r\n* A spa pool for unwinding at the end of the day\r\n* Double garaging and additional driveway parking\r\n* Zoned for great schools, including Rangitoto College, Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Northcross Intermediate\r\n\r\nFlowing directly from the dining area, the outdoor entertaining space invites summer barbecues, long lunches and relaxed evenings with friends. Established planting creates a welcoming backdrop, while the spa pool offers the perfect place to finish the day.\r\n\r\nJust 600 metres from Rothesay Bay Beach and a short stroll to local shops, this is a location that makes coastal living part of your everyday routine.\r\n\r\nAfter nearly 30 treasured years, it's time for another family to make this home their own.\r\n\r\nTo download and view property files, please copy and paste the below link into your browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/R6TC",
